{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What would you do if you were trapped in a dimension of seemingly endless rooms that went on for eternity? Based on the backrooms lore, this first person, walking simulator will take you on a 2 hour eerie adventure through a place that only exists in our nightmares. &quot;The Backrooms: Forsaken&quot; takes this concept one step further by introducing a companion character and full story to raise the stakes. If you're looking for a casual game this spooky season, and are good at mazes then &quot;The Backrooms: Forsaken&quot; is for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What to expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-First person point of view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Eerie situations and scary moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Single player campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-About 2 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Maze and Puzzle solving</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beat The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3119220/f3f502a7a6a270f294c905d894dbe9013d07d6a2.jpg"},{"name":"Let's Put A Smile On That Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3119220/a67ed982c5c9b2d9f301f30df9a508397be8b81c.jpg"},{"name":"Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3119220/e4113763c1f8a76ad34fa17a9150a03d31a0dd9d.jpg"},{"name":"Cheater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3119220/06797e367824bdcb25efa6eb06341eb6bbebb234.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3119220?t=1742478637","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119220/0d451559495ce3a6f1fef563d47f51c02b37f9ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742478637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119220/70894ed863ade8